# Nigeria Institutional Operating System (IOS) Example

## Overview

This example demonstrates how the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS) can be applied to Nigeria's governance ecosystem.

It is **illustrative**, not prescriptive.

The purpose is to show how institutional capability can be modeled across governance, procurement, Digital Public Infrastructure (DPI), public finance, and institutional coordination.

---

# National Context

Country: Federal Republic of Nigeria

Population: ~240 million

Government System: Federal Presidential Republic

Administrative Structure:

- Federal Government
- 36 States
- Federal Capital Territory
- 774 Local Government Areas

